[3.011, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\u001b[1mChecking\u001b[0m \u001b[36mexercises/14_security/audit_auth.rs\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m(compiling... the first build of the Soroban SDK can take a minute)\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[1.291, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\u001b[1m\u001b[91merror\u001b[0m: test failed, to rerun pass `-p audit_auth --lib`\r\r\n\r\r\nrunning 2 tests\r\r\n. 1/2\r\r\ntests::exploit_steal_points --- FAILED\r\r\n\r\r\nfailures:\r\r\n\r\r\n---- tests::exploit_steal_points stdout ----\r\r\n\r\r\nthread 'tests::exploit_steal_points' (6592868) panicked at /Users/Evangel/Desktop/Hackathons/sorolearn-demo/exercises/14_security/audit_auth.rs:114:9:\r\r\nthe attacker stole the victim's points!\r\r\nnote: run with `RUST_BACKTRACE=1` environment variable to display a backtrace\r\r\nWriting test snapshot file for test \"tests::exploit_steal_points\" to \"test_snapshots/tests/exploit_steal_points.1.json\".\r\r\n\r\r\n\r\r\nfailures:\r\r\n    tests::exploit_steal_points\r\r\n\r\r\ntest result: FAILED. 1 passed; 1 failed; 0 ignored; 0 measured; 0 filtered out; finished in 0.02s\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[31m✗ Exercise audit_auth is not solved yet.\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[0.000, "o", "\r\r\nProgress: [\u001b[32m######################################\u001b[0m--] 34/35\r\r\nCurrent exercise: \u001b[36mexercises/14_security/audit_auth.rs\u001b[0m\r\r\nTopic notes:      exercises/14_security/README.md\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mh\u001b[0m:hint  \u001b[1ml\u001b[0m:list  \u001b[1mr\u001b[0m:rerun  \u001b[1mq\u001b[0m:quit   \u001b[2m(press a key)\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[4.036, "o", "\r\r\n\u001b[1mHint for\u001b[0m \u001b[36maudit_auth\u001b[0m\r\r\n\r\r\nWho loses points in a transfer? That address must authorize it. Look at\r\r\nwhich address `transfer` calls `require_auth()` on. Authorizing the\r\r\n*recipient* lets anyone name themselves as `to` and pull funds from any `from`.\r\r\n\r\r\n\u001b[1mh\u001b[0m:hint  \u001b[1ml\u001b[0m:list  \u001b[1mr\u001b[0m:rerun  \u001b[1mq\u001b[0m:quit   \u001b[2m(press a key)\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
[5.162, "o", "\u001b[H\u001b[2J\u001b[3J\u001b[1mChecking\u001b[0m \u001b[36mexercises/14_security/audit_auth.rs\u001b[0m\r\r\n\u001b[2m(compiling... the first build of the Soroban SDK can take a minute)\u001b[0m\r\r\n"]
